     <actual value="67.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the reporting period, 67% of Start Ready disbursements were released before the peak of the crisis. For the DRC Flood and Madagascar Drought model, disbursements were released before the peak of the crisis. However, for the Madagascar cyclone, due to the high intensification of the crisis, the activation was on the 26th March - one day before the landfall - which did not allow members to implement anticipatory actions.</narrative>
